av\">\n        Your browser does not support the audio element.\n      </audio>\n    </td>\n  </tr>\n</table>\n\n#### Acoustic Concept Cue Relation Predictions\nThe model predicts the ordinal relationship of 6 DSP heuristic concepts between the target and foil.\n\n| Concept Cue | Target Value | Foil Value | Heuristic Relation | Model predicted relation | Match |\n| :--- | :---: | :---: | :---: | :---: | :---: |\n| **Loudness / Intensity** | `-30.9560` | `-20.6365` | `Target is LOWER` | `Target is LOWER` | **AGREE** |\n| **Pitch / Brightness (high vs low)** | `442.6702` | `524.9302` | `Target is LOWER` | `Target is LOWER` | **AGREE** |\n| **Spectral Width (broad vs narrow/tonal)** | `491.1636` | `350.5960` | `Target is HIGHER` | `Target is HIGHER` | **AGREE** |\n| **High-Frequency Shrillness** | `0.0040` | `0.0000` | `Target is SIMILAR` | `Target is SIMILAR` | **AGREE** |\n| **Crackle Spikiness (popping)** | `6.2811` | `3.5892` | `Target is SIMILAR` | `Target is HIGHER` | **DISAGREE** |\n| **Crackle / Event Density** | `2.4000` | `0.2000` | `Target is HIGHER` | `Target is HIGHER` | **AGREE** |\n\n***\n\n### Target vs. Contrast Concept: `Rhonchi`\n\n* **Contrast Exemplar Sound**: `sprsound_66315749_1.4_1_p4_5378_0.wav`\n* **Contrastive Prediction**: `Crackle` (Confidence: **83.16%**)\n* **NNRank Relation Predictor Accuracy**: **6/6 Cues Correct**\n\n#### Side-by-Side Audio Comparison (Full Context)\nListen to the target sample against the representative grounded exemplar of class `Rhonchi`:\n\n<table>\n  <tr>\n    <th align=\"center\">Target Sound Sample (Crackle)</th>\n    <th align=\"center\">Original Foil Exemplar (Rhonchi)</th>\n    <th align=\"center\">Generated Foil Contrast</th>\n  </tr>\n  <tr>\n    <td align=\"center\">\n      <audio controls>\n        <source src=\"audio/hflung_steth_20190711_target.wav\" type=\"audio/wav\">\n        Your browser does not support the audio element.\n      </audio>\n    </td>\n    <td align=\"center\">\n      <audio controls>